  "body": "Brand new and finished with real attention to detail, this Torbay home was built for families who want style without the upkeep.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is the showpiece. Warm timber-look floors run throughout, and a fluted timber feature wall adds texture to the lounge. Architectural track lighting and generous glazing keep the space bright from morning to evening. The kitchen will win over anyone who loves to cook or host. It has rich timber cabinetry with LED under-lighting, a curved stone-look island with a fluted base, brass tapware, textured tiling and quality appliances. There is plenty of storage and a lit glass display cabinet for entertaining. The dining area sits between the kitchen and living spaces and opens straight outdoors, so everyday meals and weekend gatherings flow easily between inside and out.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms offer a quiet retreat, with soft carpet, feature cove lighting and pendant bedside lights. Two full bathrooms plus a guest powder room mean no queues on busy mornings.\r\n\r\nPractical touches make daily life easy. There is a heat pump for year-round comfort, a built-in sound system, and a smart video intercom for peace of mind. The single garage has internal access and is pre-wired for an EV, with plenty of on-street parking for visitors. Being brand new and low-maintenance, it gives you more time to enjoy what Torbay does best. Local schools, village shops, parks and beaches are all close by.\r\n\r\nThe home also comes with a 10-year Stamford building warranty, so you can buy new with confidence.\r\n\r\nAt a glance\r\n\r\n• Brand-new build, low-maintenance and easy-care\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms plus guest powder room\r\n• Designer timber kitchen with fluted island, LED lighting and brass fittings\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Fluted timber feature wall, track lighting and heat pump\r\n• Built-in sound system and smart video intercom\r\n• Internal-access single garage, EV pre-wired, plus street parking\r\n• 10-year Stamford building warranty\r\n• Close to Northcross Intermediate, Glamorgan School & Long Bay College, shops, parks and beaches\r\n\r\nBrand-new homes of this calibre in Torbay are rare, so make sure you're at the first open home.",
